{
  "Npc": "widow",
  "EntryOption": "LWN_story_widow_entry",
  "EntryOptionZh": "[说两句] 领班，演得真好。",
  "EntryNode": "widow_intro",
  "Nodes": [
    {
      "Id": "widow_intro",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_intro",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：好就多赏两个钱，看戏往里站，别挡台口。\n（寡妇，玩家）：……不过看你这身打扮，不像来看戏的。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:mark",
      "EnterParam": "met",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_stage",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[搭话] 你这戏班子，天天都在城门口唱？",
          "Once": "ask_stage",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "ask_stage",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_ask_stage"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_sister",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 见过一个穿青布的姑娘吗？",
          "Once": "ask_sister",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark+clue",
          "ActionParam": "ask_sister;sister_4",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_ask_sister"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_rival",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 对台那班子是什么来路？",
          "Once": "ask_rival",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "ask_rival",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_ask_rival"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_deal",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[求门路] 给我弄一个能进城的身份。",
          "Requires": "!quest_accepted,!quest_turned,asked:ask_rival",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_deal"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_chat",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[叙旧] 今天生意怎么样？",
          "Requires": "quest_turned",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_chat"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_money",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[塞钱] 六十第纳尔，买你两句实话。",
          "Requires": "step>=1,gold>=60,asked:ask_stage,asked:ask_sister",
          "Once": "widow_money",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "widow_money",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_money_open"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_negative"
