    {
      "Id": "widow_ask_stage",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_ask_stage",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：不在这儿唱，难道喝西北风去？\n（寡妇，玩家）：城门外人杂，戏词里夹两句私货，官差也听不出来。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_ask_sister",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_ask_sister",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：穿青布的？我卖过她一张真通行文书。\n（寡妇，玩家）：后来有个穿水靠的水手把她领走了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_sister_more",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 领走她的那个水手，你还记得什么特征？",
          "Once": "sister_more",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "sister_more",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_ask_sister_2"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_ask_sister_2",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_ask_sister_2",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：那人满手都是粗缆绳磨出来的死茧，是码头帮跑船的。\n（寡妇，玩家）：我当时劝她别跟去，她说不去就没活路。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_ask_rival",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_ask_rival",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：对台那班子是码头帮捧起来的，天天堵我台口抢客。\n（寡妇，玩家）：你要能让他们闭嘴，我记你一份大人情。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_deal",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_deal",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：贵族行头我箱底有，可不是白送的。\n（寡妇，玩家）：对台领班堵着我的台口抢客，你去让他收手。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_take_job",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[应下] 这活我接了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_why",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[反问] 这种得罪人的事，你怎么不自己叫人干？",
          "Once": "widow_why",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "widow_why",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_deal_why"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_refuse",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[缓一缓] 我不替人砸戏台饭碗。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_deal_refuse"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_deal_why",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_deal_why",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：我去，他只当是两家抢生意，根本不听。\n（寡妇，玩家）：你替我把事摆平，能说服最好，动手也别出人命。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_take_job",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[应下] 这活我接了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_deal_refuse",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_deal_refuse",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：随你便。\n（寡妇，玩家）：反正没一套体面行头，正门那个铁头可不会放你过去。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_quest_accept",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_quest_accept",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：领班就在街东头，这件事算你接下了。\n（寡妇，玩家）：纠纷摆平了就来找我交割，行头给你留着。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:accept_quest",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_turnin",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_turnin",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：对台那件事，有结果了？\n（玩家，寡妇）：领班已经服软，这事摆平了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_turnin_ok",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[交差] 对台领班服软了，这事已经摆平。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_turnin_ok"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_negative",
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_turnin_ok",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_turnin_ok",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：说到做到。这身贵族戏服和护符归你，我再教你两手说话的分寸。\n（寡妇，玩家）：穿上再去见门卫，能不能瞒过去，还得看你接不接得住他的话。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:turn_in",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_chat",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_chat",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：来了？对台歇了菜，今天我这台口总算清净了。\n（寡妇，玩家）：台口那儿有张干净凳子，坐下歇歇脚吧。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_work",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 你在城门口唱戏，听说过城里的动静吗？",
          "Once": "widow_chat_2",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "widow_chat_2",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_chat_2"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial",
        "act_conversation_hip_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "widow_chat_2",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_chat_2",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：码头帮每隔五天往内城大宅送一批丫鬟，说是做绣活。\n（寡妇，玩家）：可从来没见人出来过。你进城找人，多留心东城。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "widow_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
