    {
      "Id": "widow_money_open",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_widow_money_open",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（寡妇，玩家）：爽快人。戏班子最喜欢跟爽快人打交道。\n（寡妇，玩家）：六十第纳尔放在盘里，你想问什么？",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_widow_opt_pay",
